#: scenario8:scenario8_E681D104_B68C_446D_B5FE_E46E6C1477B6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d0f2423145f5bebacf570d19c8e0f006b12031fd268763c9c346a651e6491634
