msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫But it’s all... ⟪k:2⟫covered in feathers and flapping about...⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫How are we "
"supposed to cook it?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Mais... ⟪k:2⟫il a plein de plumes et il court partout...⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Comment on va pouvoir "
"le cuisiner ?"

#: scenario8:scenario8_30426D9F_11EC_4A91_8E52_B06B67C70361
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8c7701ecc42c9b0245e7cd95833f6c40f837147dfb01014aaaed478c86ff3106
