msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Eeeeeew! No way! Absolutely not! Not in a million years!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Eeeeeerk ! Pas question ! Surtout pas ! Jamais !"

#: scenario8:scenario8_CBA189C6_D4F7_4EBA_A64C_A8A869AB74C1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 552650025d9671b8b813b45da67bc76b4f2743c909698de6f819b974231dcc2e
